<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Grupo Cementos raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Grupo Cementos raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell analyst Gordon Lee on Friday upgraded his rating for Mexico's Grupo Cementos de Chihuahua SA de CV to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- In a report, Lee said the upgrade came after the company reported better-than-expected results.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We are increasing EPS estimates by six percent to 0.51 peso for 1997 and by 13 percent to 0.68 peso for 1998 owing to stronger pricing and lower tax rates.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company rose 0.28 peso to 8.46 pesos in Mexico City.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
